WEBVTT

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:26.908
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.299
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.714 --> 00:00:33.554
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.926
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.703 --> 00:00:48.679
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.675
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:55.221
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.802 --> 00:00:58.438
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.439 --> 00:01:00.589
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.848
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.878 --> 00:01:08.010
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.545 --> 00:01:12.329
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.341 --> 00:01:14.641
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.218 --> 00:01:19.355
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.381 --> 00:01:21.781
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.782 --> 00:01:24.830
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.831 --> 00:01:27.454
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.455 --> 00:01:29.049
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:31.568
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.569 --> 00:01:34.690
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.768 --> 00:01:37.236
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.120
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.121 --> 00:01:40.654
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.002 --> 00:01:44.693
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:49.906
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.374
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:56.535 --> 00:01:59.459
Parasitic Monsters can hide inside
people and infect people.

00:01:59.488 --> 00:02:01.635
But Parasitic Monsters
that can infect people...

00:02:01.728 --> 00:02:03.310
did not appear for a long time.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:04.216
Why now?

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:05.492
Wait!

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.425
Why are these monsters
running to the school?

00:02:08.681 --> 00:02:10.188
Are they targeting us?

00:02:11.137 --> 00:02:13.177
Maybe for the three girls.

00:02:14.393 --> 00:02:15.579
What?

00:02:16.955 --> 00:02:18.830
That night, when I was
tracking the Monster Queen,

00:02:19.084 --> 00:02:21.568
the three girls from Mingzhu Academy
were assaulted by Monster Queen.

00:02:24.522 --> 00:02:27.574
Right! The Parasitic Monsters
did not kill them directly.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.664
It's because they wanted
the girls to be their hosts.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.136
Faster!

00:02:31.216 --> 00:02:32.085
It's late now!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.562
The whole school will fall
when the monsters are here!

00:02:35.861 --> 00:02:37.648
There's nobody in the school today.

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:39.415
It's weekend.

00:02:40.433 --> 00:02:41.246
That's a relief.

00:02:41.513 --> 00:02:43.930
But there's a concert
in the stadium today!

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:45.887
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:02:59.523 --> 00:03:00.310
Don't enter the stadium!

00:03:00.377 --> 00:03:01.165
It's dangerous!

00:03:02.493 --> 00:03:03.267
Are you crazy?

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.727
We're the dancers!

00:03:04.913 --> 00:03:05.793
Don't waste my time!

00:03:13.627 --> 00:03:14.793
Please don't enter!

00:03:15.746 --> 00:03:17.640
You're a funny girl.

00:03:20.041 --> 00:03:21.157
Guys, please don't enter!

00:03:21.157 --> 00:03:21.980
It's dangerous!

00:03:22.466 --> 00:03:23.266
Mo Fan?

00:03:23.452 --> 00:03:24.629
What are you trying to do?

00:03:24.869 --> 00:03:26.224
You're the most dangerous guy I know.

00:03:26.237 --> 00:03:27.118
You monster.

00:03:31.896 --> 00:03:33.096
This can't work at all.

00:03:40.329 --> 00:03:42.023
I need to contact
the Hunters' League now!

00:03:42.563 --> 00:03:45.125
But the Parasitic Monsters
are growing rapidly!

00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:47.086
If we wait for the hunters,

00:03:47.233 --> 00:03:49.910
the whole gymnasium will fall!

00:03:50.411 --> 00:03:53.070
And they'll infect the city after that!

00:03:53.279 --> 00:03:55.786
It's too late for us when that happens.

00:03:57.632 --> 00:03:58.513
Let me go in.

00:03:59.861 --> 00:04:00.995
I've killed them before.

00:04:01.248 --> 00:04:02.247
I'm experienced.

00:04:02.531 --> 00:04:04.758
Contact the Hunters' League
and the school's authorities.

00:04:04.878 --> 00:04:06.300
Ask for reinforcements.

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.780
I'll try to save as many as I can.

00:04:10.267 --> 00:04:11.374
We can only do this for now.

00:04:12.824 --> 00:04:14.944
Is there any way to stop
their transformation?

00:04:15.285 --> 00:04:17.938
I can't just kill all of those who
were infected by them, right?

00:04:19.408 --> 00:04:21.888
The parasites may be hidden
in their thumbs.

00:04:22.155 --> 00:04:25.009
Just cut their thumbs and let their
blood flow out and they'll be fine.

00:04:25.649 --> 00:04:27.450
But those who have transformed,

00:04:27.716 --> 00:04:28.836
you must kill the monsters inside them.

00:04:29.217 --> 00:04:31.430
And they'll recover.

00:04:32.159 --> 00:04:32.865
Understood.

00:04:33.292 --> 00:04:36.092
Please point me
to the infected people later.

00:04:38.042 --> 00:04:38.909
Be careful.

00:04:40.602 --> 00:04:42.096
You know my abilities, right?

00:04:46.177 --> 00:04:46.964
My goodness.

00:04:47.124 --> 00:04:48.557
It's only a concert.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.197
Why are there so many people here?

00:04:50.495 --> 00:04:52.215
You guys are troublesome!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:53.694
Ling Ling!

00:04:53.694 --> 00:04:54.693
How's the situation?

00:04:55.047 --> 00:04:57.353
I manage to contact
someone from your school.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.427
He said I was just pranking him.

00:05:00.075 --> 00:05:00.955
That's normal.

00:05:01.102 --> 00:05:02.791
who will believe you, a little girl?

00:05:03.808 --> 00:05:05.280
Did you contact
the Hunters' League then?

00:05:06.053 --> 00:05:06.629
I did.

00:05:07.007 --> 00:05:10.159
A hunter with a higher level than me
has already contacted the school.

00:05:11.128 --> 00:05:11.942
That's good.

00:05:11.995 --> 00:05:12.792
Mo Fan!

00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:13.974
There's a monster at the entrance!

00:05:14.327 --> 00:05:14.994
Where?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.466
10 m behind you!

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.291
Nothing's there.
There's nobody here.

00:05:26.934 --> 00:05:29.001
The black spot and the red spot
are at the same spot.

00:05:29.254 --> 00:05:30.546
Didn't you see it?

00:05:31.049 --> 00:05:31.755
No.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:33.603
My goodness! It's at the top!

00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:36.509
Mo Fan!

00:05:42.464 --> 00:05:44.079
Luckily, I'm a Starchart-level mage now.

00:05:44.159 --> 00:05:46.315
I have better senses than before.

00:05:46.535 --> 00:05:47.269
If not,

00:05:47.362 --> 00:05:51.147
I would've been dead by his strike from the top.

00:05:54.348 --> 00:05:55.788
Come!

00:05:55.983 --> 00:05:58.249
Show me your strength!

00:06:01.581 --> 00:06:02.583
That's all you got?

00:06:05.543 --> 00:06:07.123
Roaring Thunder!

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:13.813
Fuchsia...

00:06:13.857 --> 00:06:14.768
Exploding...

00:06:16.235 --> 00:06:17.342
Fire!

00:06:29.426 --> 00:06:30.933
Fuchsia's fire is the best!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.221
Just one Exploding Fire is enough.

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:45.015
It's just like the transformation
of the male host.

00:06:45.521 --> 00:06:46.635
I think he's okay.

00:06:49.838 --> 00:06:51.352
Water!

00:06:51.627 --> 00:06:52.294
It's you?

00:06:52.387 --> 00:06:53.537
-I...
-It's okay now.

00:06:53.867 --> 00:06:54.934
Where are your roommates?

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:55.909
I don't know.

00:06:56.366 --> 00:06:58.553
After I was assaulted,

00:06:58.857 --> 00:07:00.177
I fell unconscious.

00:07:00.934 --> 00:07:01.427
Mo Fan!

00:07:01.619 --> 00:07:02.619
Did you do it?

00:07:04.769 --> 00:07:05.675
Yeah. It's the first one.

00:07:12.891 --> 00:07:13.878
Wait here.

00:07:14.018 --> 00:07:15.261
I'll ask someone
to send you to the hospital.

00:07:16.521 --> 00:07:18.124
Please don't go!

00:07:18.432 --> 00:07:20.406
Don't worry.
You will get help soon.

00:07:22.161 --> 00:07:22.761
Ling Ling.

00:07:22.914 --> 00:07:24.357
Take that girl away.

00:07:24.358 --> 00:07:25.730
And prepare some clothes for her.

00:07:26.957 --> 00:07:29.153
I think you should stop here.

00:07:29.407 --> 00:07:31.527
We just have to complete the mission.

00:07:31.573 --> 00:07:33.316
Before everything went to hell,

00:07:33.317 --> 00:07:35.639
we've discovered that Scaly Beasts
can infect people with their blood.

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:37.679
We've done everything we could.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:38.696
Now,

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.950
I think we should wait for the
Hunters' League and the authorities.

00:07:41.197 --> 00:07:44.017
It's too dangerous inside!
Please don't do anything on your own!

00:07:44.252 --> 00:07:45.985
Tell me the location
of the next red spot.

00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:47.346
But...

00:07:48.821 --> 00:07:49.515
Fine.

00:07:49.529 --> 00:07:50.664
Just be careful then.

00:07:50.931 --> 00:07:52.851
Try to fight in places with
surveillance camera.

00:07:52.884 --> 00:07:53.967
I can help you from there.

00:07:58.958 --> 00:07:59.931
20 m in front of you!

00:08:02.858 --> 00:08:03.696
Mo Fan!

00:08:04.631 --> 00:08:05.729
Mo Fan!

00:08:05.961 --> 00:08:07.054
Are you okay?

00:08:08.039 --> 00:08:08.835
Stop shouting at me.

00:08:08.975 --> 00:08:10.069
I hit a wall.

00:08:11.076 --> 00:08:13.062
There's no path ahead, leave alone that 20m.

00:08:13.481 --> 00:08:14.467
Is there a door?

00:08:15.284 --> 00:08:16.044
No.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:17.633
Wait.

00:08:18.031 --> 00:08:20.084
I've checked the blueprint
of the stadium.

00:08:20.507 --> 00:08:21.734
Just break the wall!

00:08:23.549 --> 00:08:24.256
Break it?

00:08:25.575 --> 00:08:27.548
Chancellor Xiao will kill me for this!

00:08:28.181 --> 00:08:28.767
Faster!

00:08:29.035 --> 00:08:30.408
If not, you have to take about 200m detour.

00:08:30.468 --> 00:08:31.771
to reach the other side.

00:08:32.547 --> 00:08:33.760
What if there are students
on the other side?

00:08:33.767 --> 00:08:34.766
What if I hurt them?

00:08:34.816 --> 00:08:35.458
This...

00:08:36.066 --> 00:08:37.040
Take the detour then.

00:08:50.305 --> 00:08:51.351
Go to hell!

00:08:58.405 --> 00:08:59.324
You can't escape from me!

00:09:03.064 --> 00:09:04.266
Fire Burst!

00:09:07.665 --> 00:09:09.619
I wanted to give you a quick death,

00:09:09.635 --> 00:09:13.034
but I'll let you die in a pain
since you hurt those girls.

00:09:24.817 --> 00:09:26.123
Thank goodness I'm on time.

00:09:28.354 --> 00:09:28.927
Mo Fan!

00:09:29.034 --> 00:09:30.100
Cut her thumb open!

00:09:38.442 --> 00:09:39.830
Disgusting!

00:09:43.034 --> 00:09:44.402
Thank you.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:45.777
No problem.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.514
Your bleeding stopped instantly.

00:09:49.994 --> 00:09:51.628
Are you a healing mage?

00:09:56.115 --> 00:09:57.181
Can you use your magic now?

00:09:57.568 --> 00:09:59.264
I think I can after I'm rested.

00:10:00.831 --> 00:10:01.551
That's good.

00:10:02.791 --> 00:10:04.725
Please take care of her as well.

00:10:05.325 --> 00:10:06.575
Please hide in the emergency room.

00:10:07.048 --> 00:10:09.022
I remember there are food, water and medicine.

00:10:10.743 --> 00:10:13.049
Are there many monsters like these?

00:10:15.658 --> 00:10:16.364
Yes.

00:10:17.035 --> 00:10:18.608
They'll infect and
spread to others as well.

00:10:19.088 --> 00:10:21.877
I cut your thumb so that
you can be rid of the infection.

00:10:24.113 --> 00:10:26.911
Send others to the emergency room then.

00:10:27.145 --> 00:10:28.212
I'll heal them.

00:10:29.675 --> 00:10:30.302
Okay.

00:10:32.194 --> 00:10:32.890
Hey.

00:10:33.152 --> 00:10:34.622
Can I know your name?

00:10:36.935 --> 00:10:38.935
Don't tell me you're Lei Feng?

00:10:40.374 --> 00:10:42.691
Never mind that.
I have a bad reputation.

00:10:46.338 --> 00:10:47.462
Ling Ling, give me the next location.

00:10:47.494 --> 00:10:48.492
50 m to your right!

00:10:48.493 --> 00:10:49.561
And 100 m to your front!

00:10:49.562 --> 00:10:50.960
130 m towards your back!

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:54.010
I ran a lot today.

00:10:55.121 --> 00:10:56.114
Mo Fan! Faster!

00:10:56.349 --> 00:10:59.725
They're moving at a large scale now.
Most of them are transforming now!

00:11:00.976 --> 00:11:03.572
My goodness! How many
infected people are there?

00:11:03.725 --> 00:11:04.904
Did they infect any outsiders?

00:11:06.286 --> 00:11:09.093
-I don't think so.
-What's going on?

00:11:09.144 --> 00:11:10.673
Why are they all here?

00:11:11.072 --> 00:11:13.360
I suppose they are controlled
by the Parasitic Monsters.

00:11:13.503 --> 00:11:14.929
They wanted their hosts
to stay in the school.

00:11:15.395 --> 00:11:18.619
The mages here are young.
It seems they like younger targets.

00:11:19.465 --> 00:11:21.211
Do they think my school
is a buffet for them?

00:11:21.358 --> 00:11:23.325
They don't take me seriously, huh?

00:11:25.349 --> 00:11:26.083
Mo Fan!

00:11:26.129 --> 00:11:27.803
Three monsters picked up your scent!

00:11:29.187 --> 00:11:29.960
What?

00:11:30.719 --> 00:11:31.999
They're coming for you!

00:11:32.497 --> 00:11:33.670
Three of them?

00:11:34.667 --> 00:11:35.867
This place is too narrow.

00:11:37.502 --> 00:11:38.963
Mo Fan! Don't enter!

00:11:41.897 --> 00:11:42.897
Be careful!

00:11:43.361 --> 00:11:44.028
They're coming!

00:11:44.656 --> 00:11:45.469
Guys!

00:11:45.516 --> 00:11:46.515
Stop now!

00:11:46.559 --> 00:11:48.045
There are monsters here!

00:11:48.105 --> 00:11:49.353
And they're coming right now!

00:11:49.759 --> 00:11:51.106
We must wipe them out together!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:00.810
Mo Fan!

00:12:00.811 --> 00:12:03.495
Didn't I tell you that red spots
are all over the court?

00:12:04.562 --> 00:12:05.295
What?

00:12:09.763 --> 00:12:11.448
This is so disgusting!

00:12:11.449 --> 00:12:12.620
Ling Ling! What should I do?

00:12:12.841 --> 00:12:13.814
There's only one way.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.030
Tell me!

00:12:15.285 --> 00:12:15.872
Run!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.704
Boots of the Beast!

00:12:29.765 --> 00:12:31.409
Fine! I'll wipe them all out!

00:12:35.553 --> 00:12:36.266
Fuchsia...

00:12:38.503 --> 00:12:39.502
Fiery Fist...

00:12:41.794 --> 00:12:42.793
Heavenly Fire!

00:12:46.241 --> 00:12:46.726
One!

00:12:46.726 --> 00:12:47.505
Two!

00:12:48.217 --> 00:12:49.129
Three!

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:49.844
Four!

00:12:49.871 --> 00:12:50.591
Five!

00:12:51.518 --> 00:12:52.744
All go to hell!

00:13:08.936 --> 00:13:09.856
Amazing!

00:13:10.645 --> 00:13:11.445
What?

00:13:11.488 --> 00:13:12.487
I can't hear you.

00:13:13.008 --> 00:13:15.579
I said the monsters
we met here today...

00:13:15.632 --> 00:13:18.936
are not as strong as our previous
encounter with them in the garden.

00:13:19.289 --> 00:13:21.289
Especially the female host.

00:13:21.524 --> 00:13:23.684
She's fast and cunning.

00:13:25.492 --> 00:13:26.505
Yeah.

00:13:26.734 --> 00:13:28.520
I think they're Slave-level monsters.

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:30.767
I can't deal with
too many of them either.

00:13:31.019 --> 00:13:33.219
My situation just now
was quite dangerous.

00:13:33.966 --> 00:13:37.011
I think there are stronger monsters
in the court.

00:13:41.576 --> 00:13:44.056
It would be embarrassing
if anyone came here.

00:13:44.607 --> 00:13:45.273
It won't be.

00:13:45.673 --> 00:13:47.227
Most of them are enjoying the concert.

00:13:47.757 --> 00:13:48.891
Nobody will come here.

00:13:57.352 --> 00:13:58.476
Monster!

00:13:58.477 --> 00:13:59.078
Yes.

00:13:59.079 --> 00:14:01.056
I'm going to eat you alive.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.806
Sacred Shield!

00:14:26.323 --> 00:14:27.991
You interrupted me.

00:14:30.115 --> 00:14:31.102
Don't kill her.

00:14:31.173 --> 00:14:32.483
I think she's possessed.

00:14:32.602 --> 00:14:38.116
Were they the cause
of the rumours in the school?

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.565
I think so.

00:14:40.654 --> 00:14:41.224
Look!

00:14:41.234 --> 00:14:42.346
-It's a girl!
-Save me!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.854
Save me!

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:45.638
The situation is quite bad.

00:14:46.379 --> 00:14:50.020
I need to send her to the infirmary.
Let's report this to the school.

00:14:54.041 --> 00:14:54.694
Damn it!

00:14:55.938 --> 00:14:57.147
Why aren't you answering?

00:14:57.348 --> 00:14:59.015
Where are you? Come here immediately!

00:14:59.055 --> 00:15:02.354
Help me send her to the infirmary.
She's possessed by something.

00:15:02.476 --> 00:15:05.022
My goodness!
This is a bad timing, you know?

00:15:05.429 --> 00:15:07.869
It seems like
you're having fun over there.

00:15:08.413 --> 00:15:09.412
What happened?

00:15:09.431 --> 00:15:10.603
I'm going to get killed because of you!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:11.986
I'll hang up now!

00:15:11.987 --> 00:15:13.182
I need to get away from them!

00:15:13.924 --> 00:15:14.791
Wait! Don't hang up first!

00:15:15.317 --> 00:15:17.993
I think I hear your voice.
Are you at the stadium?

00:15:18.295 --> 00:15:18.948
Yes!

00:15:19.055 --> 00:15:19.896
Are you at the stairs?

00:15:19.896 --> 00:15:20.403
Yes!

00:15:20.613 --> 00:15:21.706
Run to your right!

00:15:21.733 --> 00:15:22.790
There's a room there!

00:15:22.791 --> 00:15:23.790
Enter the room!

00:15:26.421 --> 00:15:27.621
Here!

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:30.142
Hurry!

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.876
You have the Boots of the Beast.
Why are you scared?

00:15:35.056 --> 00:15:36.055
You look scared.

